(4128357, 593950, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrasts in the shot.  Portions look a bit over-sharpened.  Subject and composition are also good.  What I don''t like is the title - I don''t think you needed the part in parenthesis.</td>', 'I like the color contrasts in the shot.  Portions look a bit over-sharpened.  Subject and composition are also good.  What I don''t like is the title - I don''t think you needed the part in parenthesis.', '2007-10-01 10:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128358, 594002, 80904, '<td valign="top">This one is debatable. To me the subject is the spider not the flowers. I know the flower is half way, but my eyes are drawn to the spider.</td>', 'This one is debatable. To me the subject is the spider not the flowers. I know the flower is half way, but my eyes are drawn to the spider.', '2007-10-01 10:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128372, 593205, 80904, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but my eyes are drawn to the ad where the three blondes are. So to me, the subject isnt half. I see the lady in the wheelchair, but sorry to tell you, that to me that is not the subject.</td>', 'This is a great shot, but my eyes are drawn to the ad where the three blondes are. So to me, the subject isnt half. I see the lady in the wheelchair, but sorry to tell you, that to me that is not the subject.', '2007-10-01 10:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128376, 593621, 37719, '<td valign="top">Seeing as I just cut dozens of sunflowers (this morning actually) I can appreciate the perspective of this shot.  However, I find the stalk in the foreground very distracting in the photo.  Following the shot front to back it just seems there is too much to wade through to get to the subject.</td>', 'Seeing as I just cut dozens of sunflowers (this morning actually) I can appreciate the perspective of this shot.  However, I find the stalk in the foreground very distracting in the photo.  Following the shot front to back it just seems there is too much to wade through to get to the subject.', '2007-10-01 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128385, 594067, 37719, '<td valign="top">Like the concept and the photo.  However, the title kills it for me - no need for the part in parenthesis.</td>', 'Like the concept and the photo.  However, the title kills it for me - no need for the part in parenthesis.', '2007-10-01 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128464, 592536, 3102, '<td valign="top">A little brighter, and without the massive white border, this would have been a real contender!</td>', 'A little brighter, and without the massive white border, this would have been a real contender!', '2007-10-01 10:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128502, 593849, 30791, '<td valign="top">great dynamic range and clever take on the challenge</td>', 'great dynamic range and clever take on the challenge', '2007-10-01 10:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128516, 592749, 3102, '<td valign="top">Damn -- that''s fantastic!</td>', 'Damn -- that''s fantastic!', '2007-10-01 10:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128518, 593499, 70000, '<td valign="top">interesting detail, the colors seem a bit strange but i like this, it is very natural</td>', 'interesting detail, the colors seem a bit strange but i like this, it is very natural', '2007-10-01 10:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128521, 593852, 70000, '<td valign="top">awesome portrait, beautiful eye</td>', 'awesome portrait, beautiful eye', '2007-10-01 10:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128524, 592438, 70000, '<td valign="top">haha adorable! the eye is beautiful and bright and the expression is priceless</td>', 'haha adorable! the eye is beautiful and bright and the expression is priceless', '2007-10-01 10:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128526, 593194, 70000, '<td valign="top">i love the color scheme and the eye looks amazing</td>', 'i love the color scheme and the eye looks amazing', '2007-10-01 10:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128531, 593145, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love that this isn''t the typical pretty leaf shot, great detail. I wish the tip was in focus</td>', 'I love that this isn''t the typical pretty leaf shot, great detail. I wish the tip was in focus', '2007-10-01 10:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128537, 592649, 70000, '<td valign="top">The shadow over the eye pulls attention away from the face leaving the viewer trying to figure out what it is. This would be great if you messed around with the ligting to direct the focus better</td>', 'The shadow over the eye pulls attention away from the face leaving the viewer trying to figure out what it is. This would be great if you messed around with the ligting to direct the focus better', '2007-10-01 11:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128543, 593630, 30791, '<td valign="top">if this is a reference to homestarrunner.com than im with you!</td>', 'if this is a reference to homestarrunner.com than im with you!', '2007-10-01 11:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128641, 592182, 13879, '<td valign="top">James Blunt? cracking shot!</td>', 'James Blunt? cracking shot!', '2007-10-01 11:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128642, 593234, 70000, '<td valign="top">this has great technicals but it is just a picture of an apple. putting it in the center leaves the eye no where to go. this would be good stock art I guess but as a general photograph it looks stagnant to me</td>', 'this has great technicals but it is just a picture of an apple. putting it in the center leaves the eye no where to go. this would be good stock art I guess but as a general photograph it looks stagnant to me', '2007-10-01 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128760, 593852, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I know I''ll see lots of half faces but this is really well done, as you did it with light and shadow. Perfect focus and that blank stair is powerful and scary!</td>', 'Nice.  I know I''ll see lots of half faces but this is really well done, as you did it with light and shadow. Perfect focus and that blank stair is powerful and scary!', '2007-10-01 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128769, 592248, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this as it has a less contrived feeling with the light dividing the face, and not an object or a crop. The lighting is a touch harsh but it suits the expression and the idea of the fight.  What I don''t like is the smudged black under the eye. It looks a bit forced. If it were a football guy, I''d know it was something necessary on the field, but.....</td>', 'I like this as it has a less contrived feeling with the light dividing the face, and not an object or a crop. The lighting is a touch harsh but it suits the expression and the idea of the fight.  What I don''t like is the smudged black under the eye. It looks a bit forced. If it were a football guy, I''d know it was something necessary on the field, but.....', '2007-10-01 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128770, 591180, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that is AWESOME.  Funky and kitschy.</td>', 'Oh that is AWESOME.  Funky and kitschy.', '2007-10-01 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128775, 592438, 15711, '<td valign="top">If this didn''t have such good focus light and bokeh, I might say "eh, another half crop" but it''s well done and the horns on the helmet really add a nice curved line.</td>', 'If this didn''t have such good focus light and bokeh, I might say "eh, another half crop" but it''s well done and the horns on the helmet really add a nice curved line.', '2007-10-01 11:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128780, 593205, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the blur and the acidic tones.  Probably a stretch for the literal thinkers but I like it. Arty!!</td>', 'Love the blur and the acidic tones.  Probably a stretch for the literal thinkers but I like it. Arty!!', '2007-10-01 11:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128784, 592574, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus.  Not at all a fan of the brown border/frame.</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus.  Not at all a fan of the brown border/frame.', '2007-10-01 11:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128791, 593194, 15711, '<td valign="top">If this wasn''t so perfectly done, I''d say "oh here comes another face cut in half" but DAMN that is fine work.  Excellent detail, light and DOF.  If I were to change a thing, maybe that little tuft of white fur in the lower right area. Otherwise - SPOT ON.</td>', 'If this wasn''t so perfectly done, I''d say "oh here comes another face cut in half" but DAMN that is fine work.  Excellent detail, light and DOF.  If I were to change a thing, maybe that little tuft of white fur in the lower right area. Otherwise - SPOT ON.', '2007-10-01 11:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128800, 594034, 15711, '<td valign="top">The way you cropped it really enhances the shot and it doesn''t look like you just did it for this challenge.  The lighting, focus and DOF are spot on.  Honestly, I wish her mouth were closed, as the teeth and hint of shadow from inside her mouth are a touch distracting.  The eye is wonderful. Overall - great shot.</td>', 'The way you cropped it really enhances the shot and it doesn''t look like you just did it for this challenge.  The lighting, focus and DOF are spot on.  Honestly, I wish her mouth were closed, as the teeth and hint of shadow from inside her mouth are a touch distracting.  The eye is wonderful. Overall - great shot.', '2007-10-01 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128802, 592315, 15711, '<td valign="top">71???? Is that a GTO to the right? Man, gotta love those old muscle cars.  That engine is something else!!</td>', '71???? Is that a GTO to the right? Man, gotta love those old muscle cars.  That engine is something else!!', '2007-10-01 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128804, 593735, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely play of light. Maybe a bit too subtle for this crowd, but I like it. 7</td>', 'Lovely play of light. Maybe a bit too subtle for this crowd, but I like it. 7', '2007-10-01 11:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128817, 593262, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a Mapplethorpe sense to it.  Love the hint of blur from him digging in the pocket.  Wonderfully composed. Artsy. I wonder how the literal DPC voters will perceive it. Hopefully well - it deserves it.</td>', 'This has a Mapplethorpe sense to it.  Love the hint of blur from him digging in the pocket.  Wonderfully composed. Artsy. I wonder how the literal DPC voters will perceive it. Hopefully well - it deserves it.', '2007-10-01 11:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128822, 592518, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  That''s a great take on the slogan.</td>', 'ROFL  That''s a great take on the slogan.', '2007-10-01 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128828, 593304, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.  I really do not like that lacy fabric. I''d rather see her against a black or white backdrop, but that''s just me. She''s lovely.</td>', 'Lovely light.  I really do not like that lacy fabric. I''d rather see her against a black or white backdrop, but that''s just me. She''s lovely.', '2007-10-01 11:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
