(4128888, 593234, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really artfully done. I like the centering, which I normally don''t.  The light play is excellent.  I think the beige border is a touch too severe. I''d have done it at a lesser opacity and only 1 pixel if at all.  Otherwise, the shot is GREAT</td>', 'This is really artfully done. I like the centering, which I normally don''t.  The light play is excellent.  I think the beige border is a touch too severe. I''d have done it at a lesser opacity and only 1 pixel if at all.  Otherwise, the shot is GREAT', '2007-10-01 11:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128893, 593759, 15711, '<td valign="top">Have you gotten any "I''m seeing more than half her face yet?"  I like it very much.  Artful and lovely. I like the perspective and almost sad tones.</td>', 'Have you gotten any "I''m seeing more than half her face yet?"  I like it very much.  Artful and lovely. I like the perspective and almost sad tones.', '2007-10-01 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
