(4131182, 593234, 80096, '<td valign="top">Bravo! You are one of the few who actually used shadow to create half an object. This is so much more creative and imaginative than merely cutting an object in half with the camera which is what most of the others did and I am tired of viewing those unimaginative and boring entries. <br/>On the other hand, yours is worth a 10.</td>', 'Bravo! You are one of the few who actually used shadow to create half an object. This is so much more creative and imaginative than merely cutting an object in half with the camera which is what most of the others did and I am tired of viewing those unimaginative and boring entries. On the other hand, yours is worth a 10.', '2007-10-01 22:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131199, 592749, 80096, '<td valign="top">I have to commend you for the imagination and photographic skill you incorporated into your entry...it is not just another object cut in half by the camera like most of the others. In my estimation, it is worth a 10.</td>', 'I have to commend you for the imagination and photographic skill you incorporated into your entry...it is not just another object cut in half by the camera like most of the others. In my estimation, it is worth a 10.', '2007-10-01 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
