(4134826, 591888, 32997, '<td valign="top">this stands out in this challenge because it is better by showing only half of each, as though they aren''t complete without each other...</td>', 'this stands out in this challenge because it is better by showing only half of each, as though they aren''t complete without each other...', '2007-10-02 22:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
