(4134995, 593607, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge but to e it is going against the challenge description of displaying half your subject, which you could say you did by blacking out the top half of the landscape, but by doing that the subject of the photo becomes the boat....i dunno that is just my opinon</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge but to e it is going against the challenge description of displaying half your subject, which you could say you did by blacking out the top half of the landscape, but by doing that the subject of the photo becomes the boat....i dunno that is just my opinon', '2007-10-02 22:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
