(4138885, 592066, 82503, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, good lighting. And the face looks somewhat familiar. Jennifer, is that you? ;-)</td>', 'I like this one a lot, good lighting. And the face looks somewhat familiar. Jennifer, is that you? ;-)', '2007-10-03 20:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
