(4139171, 593297, 70000, '<td valign="top">lovely black and white, I would have liked to see a bigger contrast between the cup and the flower near the bottom. great shot</td>', 'lovely black and white, I would have liked to see a bigger contrast between the cup and the flower near the bottom. great shot', '2007-10-03 22:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139173, 593196, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, doesn''t really pop to me though. I think framing it so there was more attention on the half a bridge would have helped</td>', 'Interesting composition, doesn''t really pop to me though. I think framing it so there was more attention on the half a bridge would have helped', '2007-10-03 22:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139176, 593205, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow, there is so much to see in this photograph. I am not sure if it was the best for this challenge but I love the contrast between the woman in the wheelchair and the young girl walking and the pictures in the poster. Great shot</td>', 'Wow, there is so much to see in this photograph. I am not sure if it was the best for this challenge but I love the contrast between the woman in the wheelchair and the young girl walking and the pictures in the poster. Great shot', '2007-10-03 22:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139179, 593978, 70000, '<td valign="top">I wish the knife wasn''t so red, it blends into the background too much I think</td>', 'I wish the knife wasn''t so red, it blends into the background too much I think', '2007-10-03 22:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139181, 594033, 70000, '<td valign="top">nice use of lighting, I don''t think that the top and bottom halves add anything to this, I would have cropped it horizontally</td>', 'nice use of lighting, I don''t think that the top and bottom halves add anything to this, I would have cropped it horizontally', '2007-10-03 22:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139186, 593595, 70000, '<td valign="top">HAHA oh man I wonder how this was done, labor of love I guess. Very neat idea, lighting could have been more even (the bottom left has a yellow hue that throws it off i think)</td>', 'HAHA oh man I wonder how this was done, labor of love I guess. Very neat idea, lighting could have been more even (the bottom left has a yellow hue that throws it off i think)', '2007-10-03 22:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
