(4139635, 591065, 50289, '<td valign="top">I like the soft blur.  My only problem with this image is the nose.  I would have given this a higher score but just can''t get past the funny bumps on the nose...very distracting and takes away from the sharpness in the eyes.  Still...a very good entry.</td>', 'I like the soft blur.  My only problem with this image is the nose.  I would have given this a higher score but just can''t get past the funny bumps on the nose...very distracting and takes away from the sharpness in the eyes.  Still...a very good entry.', '2007-10-03 23:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139647, 591507, 50289, '<td valign="top">the whole image appears out of focus.  I''m not sure if you were trying to get a shallow DOF and just messed up on your focus or if you intended to have it this way.  Good idea with only half the petals...thinking outside the garden.</td>', 'the whole image appears out of focus.  I''m not sure if you were trying to get a shallow DOF and just messed up on your focus or if you intended to have it this way.  Good idea with only half the petals...thinking outside the garden.', '2007-10-04 00:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
