(4139681, 594047, 50289, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that we are looking at a turtle.  It''s hard to tell.  With "Advanced Editing" I''m thinking you could have done a little more with this image...cropping tighter, sharpening, color adjustments, just to name a few would have improved this entry.  Keep trying!</td>', 'I''m guessing that we are looking at a turtle.  It''s hard to tell.  With "Advanced Editing" I''m thinking you could have done a little more with this image...cropping tighter, sharpening, color adjustments, just to name a few would have improved this entry.  Keep trying!', '2007-10-04 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
