(4144653, 593659, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, and the orange flower is beautiful.</td>', 'Nice dof, and the orange flower is beautiful.', '2007-10-05 15:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144690, 593992, 74605, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The colors and composition are nice.  Nice focus on the flower!</td>', 'Very pretty.  The colors and composition are nice.  Nice focus on the flower!', '2007-10-05 15:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144746, 593769, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour scheme. Crisp details and nice composition :) good luck 8</td>', 'Very nice colour scheme. Crisp details and nice composition :) good luck 8', '2007-10-05 15:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144754, 593205, 5746, '<td valign="top">I can''t see strong connection to the challenge theme, but I love the photo itself. The colours, the composition, the emotions it wakes up. 8.</td>', 'I can''t see strong connection to the challenge theme, but I love the photo itself. The colours, the composition, the emotions it wakes up. 8.', '2007-10-05 15:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144764, 593915, 5746, '<td valign="top">It could be great Easter card project :) Toys are usually doing bad on DPC, but I wish you luck. I like the simple composition with a twist of humor and the simple colour scheme. 7.</td>', 'It could be great Easter card project :) Toys are usually doing bad on DPC, but I wish you luck. I like the simple composition with a twist of humor and the simple colour scheme. 7.', '2007-10-05 15:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144772, 593601, 5746, '<td valign="top">So sad :( Very simple, yet emotive. I like the composition very much. 8</td>', 'So sad :( Very simple, yet emotive. I like the composition very much. 8', '2007-10-05 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144780, 593935, 5746, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark. But you''ve got very good idea to convey the challenge theme.</td>', 'A bit too dark. But you''ve got very good idea to convey the challenge theme.', '2007-10-05 15:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144788, 593234, 5746, '<td valign="top">Good idea and lighting. The tiny scratches on the surface are distracting a bit and the apple is a little bit too soft, but I like the mysterious feel in this composition. 7.</td>', 'Good idea and lighting. The tiny scratches on the surface are distracting a bit and the apple is a little bit too soft, but I like the mysterious feel in this composition. 7.', '2007-10-05 15:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144795, 593538, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great colour palette. Nice and soft. I like the composition. Looks like painting in fact. 8.</td>', 'Great colour palette. Nice and soft. I like the composition. Looks like painting in fact. 8.', '2007-10-05 15:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144799, 593469, 5746, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of somebody experiments with different kitchen appliances :) Very, very nice and fresh idea and very good execution. 7.</td>', 'It reminds me of somebody experiments with different kitchen appliances :) Very, very nice and fresh idea and very good execution. 7.', '2007-10-05 15:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144815, 592220, 5746, '<td valign="top">Oh my... what an expression. I love this dogs :) Great title as well :))</td>', 'Oh my... what an expression. I love this dogs :) Great title as well :))', '2007-10-05 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144820, 593804, 5746, '<td valign="top">Looks like a deep space :) Great composition and texture details. 7.</td>', 'Looks like a deep space :) Great composition and texture details. 7.', '2007-10-05 15:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144829, 593759, 5746, '<td valign="top">Brings the soul music to my mind. I love it. The colours, the detail of the veil, the beautiful eyelashes, the lips. 9.</td>', 'Brings the soul music to my mind. I love it. The colours, the detail of the veil, the beautiful eyelashes, the lips. 9.', '2007-10-05 16:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144832, 593630, 5746, '<td valign="top">Thricky shot. Very DPC. The quality and colours are amazing. 9.</td>', 'Thricky shot. Very DPC. The quality and colours are amazing. 9.', '2007-10-05 16:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144837, 593494, 5746, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what kind of bug it is, but I remember I used to be afraid of them (just in case). I love the way you captured this creature. This is exactly what I had in mind thinking about Half challenge. Pictures, which show half of something in a natural way. 7</td>', 'I have no idea what kind of bug it is, but I remember I used to be afraid of them (just in case). I love the way you captured this creature. This is exactly what I had in mind thinking about Half challenge. Pictures, which show half of something in a natural way. 7', '2007-10-05 16:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144927, 594071, 78388, '<td valign="top">Great macro!</td>', 'Great macro!', '2007-10-05 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144934, 593495, 5746, '<td valign="top">half Tina would''ve been enough :) teddy and an apple are a bit distracting. She doesn''t need any competition. Lovely girl, and sweet idea for the challenge theme intepretation. 7.</td>', 'half Tina would''ve been enough :) teddy and an apple are a bit distracting. She doesn''t need any competition. Lovely girl, and sweet idea for the challenge theme intepretation. 7.', '2007-10-05 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144936, 593658, 5746, '<td valign="top">She is so beautiful... I like that you decided to use her hand, instead of cutting her face into two atrificially like so many participants in this challenge. Great detail and quality. I like also the fact that it is B&amp;W. It brings out her beauty even more. 9</td>', 'She is so beautiful... I like that you decided to use her hand, instead of cutting her face into two atrificially like so many participants in this challenge. Great detail and quality. I like also the fact that it is B&W. It brings out her beauty even more. 9', '2007-10-05 16:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144946, 593590, 68035, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm I am confused with this picture as I cant decide whether I really like it or dont like it at all.  I am not normally a big fan of soft focus shots like this and when I look at it I feel that I am seeing an enlarged element of a much larger image, yet there is something about the way you have used the curtain as a frame and the colouring which is very appealing.  My guess is that this will be ''punished'' (I hate that term) by quite a few voters because it is outside the norm.  So let me redress the balance a touch by going with my positive thoughts and giving it a 7</td>', 'Hmmmm I am confused with this picture as I cant decide whether I really like it or dont like it at all.  I am not normally a big fan of soft focus shots like this and when I look at it I feel that I am seeing an enlarged element of a much larger image, yet there is something about the way you have used the curtain as a frame and the colouring which is very appealing.  My guess is that this will be ''punished'' (I hate that term) by quite a few voters because it is outside the norm.  So let me redress the balance a touch by going with my positive thoughts and giving it a 7', '2007-10-05 16:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144959, 591782, 77838, '<td valign="top">Yea; San Francisco, Bay Bridge, American Airlines (that''s what it looks like anyway)!</td>', 'Yea; San Francisco, Bay Bridge, American Airlines (that''s what it looks like anyway)!', '2007-10-05 16:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144964, 593494, 77838, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF in my opinion. 8</td>', 'Perfect DOF in my opinion. 8', '2007-10-05 16:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145000, 594090, 77838, '<td valign="top">Cool idea but it''s just a little narrow of photo for me.  I wish the words had a little more space between them.  Excellent photo though -6.  BB</td>', 'Cool idea but it''s just a little narrow of photo for me.  I wish the words had a little more space between them.  Excellent photo though -6.  BB', '2007-10-05 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145010, 592510, 77838, '<td valign="top">That would''ve been cool to have a little lower approach to the photo so that the grave stone would''ve been silhouetted on the horizon with her.  Just my opinion here, so take with a grain of salt please.  BB</td>', 'That would''ve been cool to have a little lower approach to the photo so that the grave stone would''ve been silhouetted on the horizon with her.  Just my opinion here, so take with a grain of salt please.  BB', '2007-10-05 16:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
