(4148187, 593194, 82259, '<td valign="top">Oooh..... the eyes! The colors are just right. My favorite so far in this challenge.</td>', 'Oooh..... the eyes! The colors are just right. My favorite so far in this challenge.', '2007-10-07 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
