(4148768, 593330, 82814, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful &amp; effective.  I think the challenge was well presented.  If I could change anything about this capture, I would not have included the light bulb in the top left corner.  This would have made the photograph half black space, half subject, therefore accentuating the half concept on two levels.  Just a thought, not a criticism.  Well done.</td>', 'Simple, beautiful & effective.  I think the challenge was well presented.  If I could change anything about this capture, I would not have included the light bulb in the top left corner.  This would have made the photograph half black space, half subject, therefore accentuating the half concept on two levels.  Just a thought, not a criticism.  Well done.', '2007-10-07 07:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148769, 593759, 58247, '<td valign="top">Simply Beautiful.</td>', 'Simply Beautiful.', '2007-10-07 07:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
