(4150857, 593657, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Whatcha gonna do."  Well, for starters, quit whining.  A top 10 doesn''t exactly suck, and it''s a gorgeous portrait.  Your conscientious efforts to try new things and do them the best you can are regularly rewarded by results of shoots like this one - and by that I mean the photograph, not the DPC placement.</td>', '"Whatcha gonna do."  Well, for starters, quit whining.  A top 10 doesn''t exactly suck, and it''s a gorgeous portrait.  Your conscientious efforts to try new things and do them the best you can are regularly rewarded by results of shoots like this one - and by that I mean the photograph, not the DPC placement.', '2007-10-08 03:12:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4150866, 593756, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why I like this one so much, but I think it''s because of the "time gone by" aspect - and the fact your light, your composition, your clarity and your choice of processing are all dead-on perfect for this shot.  Very well done and congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'I''m not sure why I like this one so much, but I think it''s because of the "time gone by" aspect - and the fact your light, your composition, your clarity and your choice of processing are all dead-on perfect for this shot.  Very well done and congrats on the top 10.', '2007-10-08 03:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
