(4150931, 594033, 53814, '<td valign="top">Great eye for the absurd. Most good photos only evoke one emotion from the viewer, this one delivers two gut wrenchings - once for the brief second when the cat appears to be dead and again for the laugh after the truth is realized. Technically, you have made wonderful use of lighting to accentuate the "dead" leg with the strong "chicken leg" shadow. Wonderful photo.</td>', 'Great eye for the absurd. Most good photos only evoke one emotion from the viewer, this one delivers two gut wrenchings - once for the brief second when the cat appears to be dead and again for the laugh after the truth is realized. Technically, you have made wonderful use of lighting to accentuate the "dead" leg with the strong "chicken leg" shadow. Wonderful photo.', '2007-10-08 03:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
