(4154194, 594002, 67579, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lovethelight:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow I cannot believe people....only two comments? The detail in this one is just unbelievable and the position of the spider works perfectly in the composition. I agree that it fitting the challenge can be questioned but as a photograph you have taken a classic pretty flower picture and turned it into something more. I gave this a nine. Fabulous shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Aw now you got me turning all red and stuff, Thanks Claire :D<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Originally posted by lovethelight: Wow I cannot believe people....only two comments? The detail in this one is just unbelievable and the position of the spider works perfectly in the composition. I agree that it fitting the challenge can be questioned but as a photograph you have taken a classic pretty flower picture and turned it into something more. I gave this a nine. Fabulous shot   Aw now you got me turning all red and stuff, Thanks Claire :D -dave', '2007-10-09 11:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
