(4159041, 593441, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like the gritty low-color effect of this shot. It gives me a feel of what life must be like in that hot place. I can almost see the heat rising in the background. I also like the sharp focus and the rhythms of the tire, the grille, and the lights ... three separate rhythms playing together. I like the contrast in the long shadows on the ground too.<br/> <br/>P.S. I just noticed the spring adding yet another rhythm to this composition. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-10 21:46:25.</i></td>', 'I really like the gritty low-color effect of this shot. It gives me a feel of what life must be like in that hot place. I can almost see the heat rising in the background. I also like the sharp focus and the rhythms of the tire, the grille, and the lights ... three separate rhythms playing together. I like the contrast in the long shadows on the ground too. P.S. I just noticed the spring adding yet another rhythm to this composition. ', '2007-10-10 22:43:01.000000', '2007-10-10 22:46:25.000000', 0),
(4159345, 593262, 53814, '<td valign="top">fantastic</td>', 'fantastic', '2007-10-11 01:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
