(4162253, 593577, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful eye, and I really like the PP. I like the way the outline of the eye and the lashes look sketched. I guess it is a little too artistic for this crowd. And I bet some of the people didn''t see it as fitting the challenge, although I see a double fit -- half a pair and half an iris.</td>', 'This is a beautiful eye, and I really like the PP. I like the way the outline of the eye and the lashes look sketched. I guess it is a little too artistic for this crowd. And I bet some of the people didn''t see it as fitting the challenge, although I see a double fit -- half a pair and half an iris.', '2007-10-12 08:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4162261, 593952, 66384, '<td valign="top">Jeb, this is the most artistic shot I''ve seen you do, and I really like it. I love your composition, the colors, the lighting, and the setup. Excellent!!</td>', 'Jeb, this is the most artistic shot I''ve seen you do, and I really like it. I love your composition, the colors, the lighting, and the setup. Excellent!!', '2007-10-12 08:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
