(4167413, 593179, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the focus, detail, and light. The eye is beautiful, and the shine of the eyebrows and hair is great. I like the shadow of the eyelashes across the eye. And the skin is so clear and soft. Really a wonderful shot. Congratulations, Lea.</td>', 'I love the focus, detail, and light. The eye is beautiful, and the shine of the eyebrows and hair is great. I like the shadow of the eyelashes across the eye. And the skin is so clear and soft. Really a wonderful shot. Congratulations, Lea.', '2007-10-14 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167425, 593950, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color. I read your processing description. I would love to see the original and a few of the steps you made toward this very nice end. You have really brought life to this old ruin.</td>', 'Wonderful color. I read your processing description. I would love to see the original and a few of the steps you made toward this very nice end. You have really brought life to this old ruin.', '2007-10-14 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 0),
