(4177791, 593194, 63269, '<td valign="top">Back for a second comment, I think I know what to say now. :) I put this up on my desktop background the moment I saw it. And it''s still there. Your cat has been silently staring at me for over a week. I simply can''t get over the startling, exquisite beauty of this image! The clarity of the focus is breath-taking, and the sweet colors make me want to stroke her cheek and give her a little scratch behind the ear. Splendid, <i>glorious </i>photo. :)</td>', 'Back for a second comment, I think I know what to say now. :) I put this up on my desktop background the moment I saw it. And it''s still there. Your cat has been silently staring at me for over a week. I simply can''t get over the startling, exquisite beauty of this image! The clarity of the focus is breath-taking, and the sweet colors make me want to stroke her cheek and give her a little scratch behind the ear. Splendid, glorious photo. :)', '2007-10-18 08:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
